KG42.register("clusters-69500340de63173e18688614",{"id":"12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v142-d-K001","paper":"12-p2p_microgrid_trading","label":"Participant, product, and role conditions for direct local energy trading","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Participant, product, and role conditions for direct local energy trading","market_meaning":"Organizes local energy products, consumer participation, and prosumer role conditions together with permission for direct trading among peers into a qualitative rule defining the scope of trading.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["activation","participation","bidding"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The four chains fall within the general P2P definition. The respective scopes of applicability of on-premises distributed energy products, peers at multiple scales, and the prosumer role model in the paper are retained; these do not imply identical operational or clearing arrangements across scales.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Participating entities, tradable products, and direct trading activities jointly specify who may trade what. The content concerning surplus electricity sales in R001 and R003 represents the execution and participation perspectives of the same permission and is not counted as separate rules; settlement obligations are assigned to a separate cluster.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the direct trading activity and its conditions concerning surplus electricity and peer scale."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Supplements the scope of participating entities by specifying consumer participation as individuals or groups."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Supplements prosumers' permission to sell and the conditions for role transitions in the model."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Defines the local energy products involved in direct trading."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-02"],"rationale":"The same definitional paragraph explains both the forms of peer participation and the mode of direct trading; the two chains retain the respective scopes of entities and activities."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-03"],"rationale":"The participation permission and selling activity when a prosumer has surplus electricity refer to the same trading situation; other disposal options are retained, and no obligation to sell is inferred."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-01","v141-b-g01-ev-02"],"rationale":"The product definition specifies the energy sources and local trading scope of direct P2P trading, complementing the trading mode without adding product pricing or delivery constraints."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"All B entries on which this cluster is based remain unverified; the experiment permits candidate assembly, which does not mean that the transcription or scientific interpretation has been independently reviewed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-01","v141-b-g01-ev-02","v141-b-g01-ev-03","v141-b-g01-ev-08","v141-b-g01-ev-09"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the corresponding original text and each provision's scope of applicability with respect to scale and model, retaining the frozen chain records."}]},"rule_refs":["12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R001","12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R002","12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R003","12-p2p_microgrid_trading::v141-c-R004"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-3fcd5e2d02ec7c3f","COMP-45aa318377a72aa8","COMP-4fd16cbd90d234cb","COMP-a774da994c2ca212"]});
